      "body": "## Summary\n\nFixed several spelling errors found via codespell static analysis:\n\n1. **benchmark scripts**: Changed \"United Kindom\" to \"United Kingdom\" in prompt strings:\n   - `python/sglang/benchmark/one_batch.py` (2 occurrences)\n   - `scripts/playground/reference_hf.py` (2 occurrences)\n\n2. **C++ kernel comment**: Changed \"contuguous\" to \"contiguous\" in:\n   - `python/sglang/kernels/aot/csrc/cpu/mamba/fla.cpp`\n\n## Files changed\n\n- `python/sglang/benchmark/one_batch.py` - Fixed 2 spelling errors in benchmark prompts\n- `scripts/playground/reference_hf.py` - Fixed 2 spelling errors in reference prompts\n- `python/sglang/kernels/aot/csrc/cpu/mamba/fla.cpp` - Fixed 1 spelling error in comment\n\n## Testing\n\n- [x] I ran codespell and verified no additional errors remain\n- [ ] I ran related tests (no code logic changes, only spelling fixes)\n\nSigned-off-by: yancy <yancy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #38557258525](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38557258525)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #38557258193](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38557258193)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #38557258360](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38557258360)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
